      "title": "Stargate frame parts",
      "subtitle": "Let the first frame come out first",
      "description": [
        "\"The door knocker, beacon upgrade and Pegasus DHD all use frame components. Complete the assembly line study first and then start processing.\""
      ],
      "tasks": [
