    },
    {
      "id": "4B50ED48B36D1D80",
      "title": "Tea",
      "subtitle": "It is used for both the guide block and the base",
      "description": [
        "\"Both the Guide Block and the Base Block need tea. Give this Chrono Assembly Line enough buckets and marshmallow hearts to wait for the first batch to be completed.\"",
        "\"The research station uses fish as samples. Research parameters and production materials can be viewed in JEI.\""
      ],
