      "title": "cosmic stargate guide",
      "subtitle": "Complete research with shields first",
      "description": [
        "\"First use the stargate radiation protection plate to complete the research, and then proceed to the assembly line to process the cosmic stargate guide mark.\"",
        "\"It will be consumed by door knocker and guide sign upgrades, and the remaining two assembly lines must be reserved separately.\""
      ],
