      "title": "crystal pedestal",
      "subtitle": "Slurry sent to space assembly process",
      "description": [
        "\"Send the stargate crystal slurry into the space assembly process to make a crystal base. Remember to provide the MK5 power module.\"",
        "\"You need one for the door base, and three more for the Pegasus DHD.\""
