      "title": "Stargate guide upgrade",
      "subtitle": "Frame and cosmic guide meet here",
      "description": [
        "\"The frame parts, cosmic stargate guide and MAX parts are ready, and the stargate guide upgrade can be made.\"",
        "\"9×9 endless synthesis and nightmare synthesis use the same investment, just choose one method according to the existing equipment.\""
