      "subtitle": "Make the door knocker first",
      "description": [
        "\"Assemble the frame components, space guide, protective plate and reaction chamber into a door knocker. Please see JEI for complete materials.\"",
        "\"The door knocker will be further processed into guide blocks, leaving another fourteen blocks for the final swing of the door.\""
