      "id": "4B53CE02986691A3",
      "title": "Stargate base block",
      "subtitle": "The entire door is activated from here",
      "description": [
        "\"Assemble the guide block, crystal base and materials sent from each branch line into the stargate base.\"",
        "\"When it is completed, take out the reserved door knocker and guide block, and then you can go outside the factory to build the door.\""
      ],
