      "icon": "sgjourney:pegasus_dhd"
    },
    {
      "id": "4B5ADA51B3F91F12",
      "title": "The first step outside the door",
      "subtitle": "Tools, supplies, and a cell phone on",
      "description": [
        "\"The fish-sized puppet stayed at the base. You walked around to the camera and waved, then walked towards the wormhole with tools and supplies.\"",
        "\"There was a strong wind outside the door. The phone asked you what you saw. When you raised your head, you realized that you had walked out of the familiar factory.\""
      ],
      "tasks": [
        {
          "id": "4B5CE2898DE5FFDC",
          "type": "advancement",
          "advancement": "sgjourney:adventure/use_stargate",
          "criterion": ""
        }
      ],
      "dependencies": [
        "4B51AD5256FB6064"
      ],
      "x": 28,
      "y": 16,
      "icon": "minecraft:compass"
    },
    {
      "id": "4B5A7AC59C392D25",
      "title": "welcome back",
      "subtitle": "Redial the number outside the door and return to where you started.",
      "description": [
        "\"Bring back the markers along the way, a few samples, and the photo where half of the sky was blocked by the equipment.\"",
        "\"Recall the starting point from that end. When you see the lights in the factory area again, Yu Da has already put away the observation data of the two highlands, waiting for you to come back and fill in the part you saw with your own eyes.\""
      ],
      "tasks": [
        {
          "id": "4B5FEF64E351F76C",
          "type": "custom",
          "title": "I set off via the Star Gate and return to the starting point via the Star Gate",
          "tags": [
            "hk3gtl_candidate_stargate_return",
            "hk3gtl_quest_stargate_return"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "dependencies": [
        "4B5ADA51B3F91F12"
      ],
      "x": 28,
      "y": 20,
      "icon": "minecraft:recovery_compass"
    },
    {
      "id": "4B5D2A33F0DB2367",
      "title": "write down the route",
      "subtitle": "That point on the star map now has the path you took.",
      "description": [
        "\"You draw the locations of the two highlands and add provenance to the samples. Yu Da puts these next to the old observation. The original small dot finally looks like it can be looked at carefully.\"",
        "\"The bad photos are also kept. When you go again in the future, you will probably still think of yourself standing there for the first time, holding up the equipment to find the angle.\"",
        "\"Put the records away tonight. Tomorrow, the factory will still be in operation, and there are many places to go outside the door.\""
      ],
      "tasks": [
        {
